/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 232 0 R
/T (SKILLXCHANGE IS A DYNAMIC AND COLLABORATIVE PLATFORM DESIGNED TO CONNECT INDIVIDUALS WHO ARE EAGER TO LEARN NEW SKILLS WITH THOSE WILLING TO TEACH. IN AN ERA WHERE CONTINUOUS LEARNING AND UPSKILLING ARE ESSENTIAL, SKILLXCHANGE PROVIDES A PEER-TO-PEER LEARNING ENVIRONMENT WHERE USERS CAN EXCHANGE KNOWLEDGE AND EXPERTISE WITHOUT TRADITIONAL INSTITUTIONAL BOUNDARIES. THE PLATFORM FOSTERS A COMMUNITY-DRIVEN ECOSYSTEM WHERE LEARNING IS DECENTRALIZED, ACCESSIBLE, AND PERSONALISED.)
/E (SKILLXCHANGE IS A DYNAMIC AND COLLABORATIVE PLATFORM DESIGNED TO CONNECT INDIVIDUALS WHO ARE EAGER TO LEARN NEW SKILLS WITH THOSE WILLING TO TEACH. IN AN ERA WHERE CONTINUOUS LEARNING AND UPSKILLING ARE ESSENTIAL, SKILLXCHANGE PROVIDES A PEER-TO-PEER LEARNING ENVIRONMENT WHERE USERS CAN EXCHANGE KNOWLEDGE AND EXPERTISE WITHOUT TRADITIONAL INSTITUTIONAL BOUNDARIES. THE PLATFORM FOSTERS A COMMUNITY-DRIVEN ECOSYSTEM WHERE LEARNING IS DECENTRALIZED, ACCESSIBLE, AND PERSONALISED.)
/Pg 11 0 R
