<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 234 0 R
/E (SkillXchange is an innovative mutual mentoring learning platform designed to connect individuals eager to learn with experts willing to share their skills and knowledge. This project aims to create an accessible, flexible, and community-driven environment that fosters reciprocal learning and skill development. The motivation behind SkillXchange stems from the recognition that traditional educational platforms often face challenges such as limited accessibility, high costs, inflexible schedules, and lack of personalized learning. By leveraging peer-to-peer mentoring, this platform seeks to address these gaps and empower users to ignite their minds, innovate futures, and promote equality through shared learning experiences.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
